.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-wiring-gate 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-wiring\-gate \- Link every git hook in this clone to the running batten binary, or both commit hooks to a checked\-in body
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten wiring gate\fR [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIbody\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Link every git hook in this clone to the running batten binary, or both commit hooks to a checked\-in body
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
Exit non\-zero if a git hook link is owed, and write nothing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIbody\fR]
A hook body to link both commit hooks to, relative to the repository root
